@startuml
left to right direction
actor "사용자" as User
node "Docker 호스트" {
  node "앱 컨테이너" as App {
    artifact "Spring Boot + React" as WebApp
  }
  node "PostgreSQL 컨테이너" as DbContainer {
    database "packingmate" as DB
  }
  node "Docker named volume\npostgres-data" as Volume
}
cloud "외부 API:\nOpen-Meteo" as OpenMeteo
cloud "외부 API:\nNASA POWER" as NasaPower

User --> App : HTTP
App --> DbContainer : SQL
DbContainer -- Volume : 데이터 디렉터리 마운트
App --> OpenMeteo : HTTPS
App --> NasaPower : HTTPS (예보 공백 시)
@enduml
